#: ../../tools/neurovault_tools.rst:131 54ffb74b7b7a4f60a8a29c88a8d53e49
msgid ""
"**Description**: List and browse neuroimaging statistical map collections"
" from NeuroVault. Returns collections of brain images (fMRI, PET, EEG) "
"contributed by researchers worldwide. Each collection contains metadata "
"about the study, DOI, authors, and imaging parameters. NeuroVault hosts "
"over 16,000 collections with 650,000+ brain images. Use limit and offset "
"for pagination. Use this to discover available neuroimaging datasets for "
"meta-analysis or to find specific studies."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/neurovault_tools.rst:135 412f10b3dff046bf94085698dd4b4536
msgid ""
